{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חַ֫יִל","hw":"חַ֫יִל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַ֫יִל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. power, strength, army (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, חול\" href=\"/BDB,_חול\", dir=\"rtl\">II. חול</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, חול\" href=\"/BDB,_חול\", dir=\"rtl\">חיל</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>power:</em> abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאֶדְרָע וְחָ֑יִל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:23\" href=\"/Ezra.4.23\">Ezr 4:23</a> <em>by force and power;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">קרא בְח׳</span> i.e. <em>call loudly</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:4\" href=\"/Daniel.3.4\">Dn 3:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחַיִל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:11\" href=\"/Daniel.4.11\">4:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבָּרֵי־ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:20\" href=\"/Daniel.3.20\">3:20</a> <em>mighty men of power</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>force, army</em>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיְלֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:20\" href=\"/Daniel.3.20\">3:20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵיל שְׁמַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:32\" href=\"/Daniel.4.32\">4:32</a> (= BH <span dir=\"rtl\">צְבָא הַשָּׁמַיִם</span>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, חַכִּים","prev":"BDB Aramaic, חֵיוָא"}